---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { METRIC_DEFINITIONS } from "@lib/workflow/metrics";

const definitions = METRIC_DEFINITIONS;
---

<details class="group card bg-base-100 border-base-300 border shadow-sm">
  <summary
    class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 p-4 select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
  >
    <Icon
      name="boxicons:book-open"
      size={18}
      class="text-secondary shrink-0"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
    <h2 class="text-base-content text-sm font-semibold">
      ¿Cómo se calcula cada métrica?
    </h2>
    <Icon
      name="boxicons:chevron-down"
      size={16}
      class="text-base-content/40 ml-auto transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
  </summary>
  <div class="border-base-300 border-t p-4">
    <dl class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        definitions.map((definition) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
            <dt class="text-base-content text-sm font-semibold">
              {definition.label}
            </dt>
            <dd class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
              {definition.description}
            </dd>
            {definition.formula && (
              <dd class="text-base-content/50 font-mono text-xs">
                {definition.formula}
              </dd>
            )}
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </dl>
    <p class="text-base-content/50 mt-4 text-xs">
      Los indicadores se calculan sobre el historial local del portal
      (`automation_parents`). El progreso persistido sólo existe para casos
      abiertos alguna vez y las fechas estimadas sólo para títulos con fecha
      (workflow AUTSUC).
    </p>
  </div>
</details>
